; Specification layer of fiat-crypto (https://github.com/mit-plv/fiat-crypto,
; commit f7f2d538, MIT/Apache-2.0/BSD-1), vendored under the logical root
; Fiat because fiat-crypto's own root Crypto collides with this project's
; Crypto theory. Only the dependency closure of Spec/Curve25519.v,
; Curves/Edwards/AffineProofs.v, Curves/Edwards/XYZT/Basic.v,
; Algebra/ScalarMult.v and Arithmetic/PrimeFieldTheorems.v is included;
; Require lines were rewritten (Crypto. -> Fiat., Coq. -> Stdlib.), nothing else.
(include_subdirs qualified)
(rocq.theory
 (name Fiat)
 (synopsis "Vendored fiat-crypto specification of Curve25519 / Ed25519")
 (modules (:standard))
 (flags (:standard -w -all))
 (theories Stdlib Coqprime))
